WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.970 --> 00:00:07.813
- Welcome, everyone.

00:00:08.830 --> 00:00:10.930
Thank you for joining me online

00:00:10.930 --> 00:00:12.780
to celebrate the accomplishments

00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:15.433
of the students of the Class of 2020.

00:00:16.390 --> 00:00:17.800
To the graduating students,

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:20.760
I am grateful that we
can gather as a community

00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:24.283
in this way to honor all
that you have achieved.

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:29.493
However, this is no
replacement for Commencement.

00:00:30.520 --> 00:00:31.930
When it is safe to do so,

00:00:31.930 --> 00:00:34.150
I will welcome you back to campus

00:00:34.150 --> 00:00:37.160
to participate in a
traditional Yale graduation

00:00:37.160 --> 00:00:38.433
with your classmates.

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:40.720
In the meantime,

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:42.010
your deans and I

00:00:42.010 --> 00:00:45.723
officially mark your
graduation from Yale this year.

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:49.140
We recognize the extraordinary work

00:00:49.140 --> 00:00:52.850
all of you have completed
in your programs of study.

00:00:52.850 --> 00:00:56.740
We salute your effort, your
diligence, your talent,

00:00:56.740 --> 00:00:57.883
and your intellect.

00:00:58.870 --> 00:01:01.410
We also join you in expressing gratitude

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:05.140
for all who have supported
you in these endeavors.

00:01:05.140 --> 00:01:07.360
Your families and friends,

00:01:07.360 --> 00:01:10.293
professors, and other members
of the Yale community.

00:01:11.770 --> 00:01:16.200
It is now my great pleasure
to officially confer

00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:17.473
your Yale degrees.

00:01:19.550 --> 00:01:23.170
To those who have completed
your degree requirements,

00:01:23.170 --> 00:01:26.820
you have been recommended by
the faculty of your school

00:01:26.820 --> 00:01:30.400
and your dean has asked
me by my official act

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:33.920
to confer upon you your degree.

00:01:33.920 --> 00:01:36.260
With the approval of the Yale Corporation

00:01:36.260 --> 00:01:39.050
and by the authority vested in me,

00:01:39.050 --> 00:01:41.560
I confer upon you your degree

00:01:41.560 --> 00:01:43.800
as designated by your dean

00:01:43.800 --> 00:01:47.813
and admit you to all its
rights and responsibilities.

00:01:49.810 --> 00:01:50.643
Some of you

00:01:50.643 --> 00:01:53.473
will complete your degree
requirements after today.

00:01:54.350 --> 00:01:57.310
When you have been recommended
by the faculty of your school

00:01:57.310 --> 00:01:59.730
and approved by the Yale Corporation,

00:01:59.730 --> 00:02:03.070
your dean shall ask me by my official act

00:02:03.070 --> 00:02:05.363
to confer upon you your degree.

00:02:06.780 --> 00:02:08.300
By the authority vested in me,

00:02:08.300 --> 00:02:11.080
I shall confer upon you your degree

00:02:11.080 --> 00:02:13.100
when designated by the dean

00:02:13.100 --> 00:02:15.350
and shall then admit you

00:02:15.350 --> 00:02:19.010
to all its rights and responsibilities.

00:02:19.010 --> 00:02:22.973
Congratulations to the Class of 2020.

